      "1": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Size Based Shapes\nThis example demonstrates all shapes that have only one parameter: size.\nWhen modulating size, make sure that you use positive values otherwise the shape is not visible.\n\nPatch Explained -\n\n• The Sine runs values from 0.1 to 1 and affects the size of the shapes.\n• All shapes go into a Switch that is controlled by the Int(signal) node.\n• Use the slider of the Int(signal) to switch between the shapes.\n"
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
